in{aligned}A-(-4)I & =[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -3\\end{aligned}]-(-4)[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSeeking a non-zero solution of $(A-(-4)I)x=0$ gives the eigenvector ${v}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].$ Dividing ${v}_{2}$ by its norm $‖{v}_{2}‖=\\sqrt{2},$ we get \n\n$$\n\\frac{{v}_{2}}{‖{v}_{2}‖}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nFinally, we construct the diagonal matrix $D$ (writing the eigenvalues in descending order) and the orthogonal matrix $P$ in the usual way, and this gives us the following:\n\n$$\nD=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -4\\end{aligned}],\\,P=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} & -\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\end{aligned}]\n$$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399458 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399459 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399458 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399460 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399458 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399461 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399458 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399462 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399458 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399463 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399458 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399458 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399458 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399460 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399458 1080 #uuid "af751c8a-d34c-5ece-8db8-ee7406d5299f" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399459 1081 "$D=[\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2\\end{aligned}]$ and $P=[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} & -\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\\\ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} & \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\end{aligned}]$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399459 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399459 1084 #uuid "22954aba-c66f-5f8