}_{2}+1-1) & =8 \\\\ 6{y}_{1}^{2}+4{({y}_{2}+1)}^{2}-4 & =8 \\\\ 6{y}_{1}^{2}+4{({y}_{2}+1)}^{2} & =12\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, performing the change of variables\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{z}_{1}={y}_{1}, \\\\ {z}_{2}={y}_{2}+1,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwe get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}6{z}_{1}^{2}+4{z}_{2}^{2} & =12 \\\\ \\frac{{z}_{1}^{2}}{2}+\\frac{{z}_{2}^{2}}{3} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{{z}_{1}^{2}}{(\\sqrt{2})^{2}}+\\frac{{z}_{2}^{2}}{(\\sqrt{3})^{2}} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis represents an ellipse with semiaxes $\\sqrt{2}$ and $\\sqrt{3}.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399493 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399494 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399493 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399495 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399493 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399496 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399493 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399497 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399493 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399498 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399493 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399493 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399493 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399494 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399493 1080 #uuid "c636ffab-f93d-536a-8095-481a8e5251a5" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399494 1081 "An ellipse with semiaxes $\\sqrt{2}$ and $\\sqrt{3}$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399494 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399494 1084 #uuid "009d90b0-3f22-584e-98f4-8d3934ce65dc" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399495 1081 "A hyperbola with semiaxes $\\frac{1}{2}$ and $\\frac{1}{3}$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399495 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399495 1084 #uuid "ce86b767-8088-5585-afa8-b24d88783528" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399496 1081 "An ellipse with semiaxes $1$ and $2$" 131941